；今不幸而母以天年終。仲子所欲報仇者爲誰？請得從事焉！」嚴仲子具告曰：「臣之仇韓相俠累，俠累又韓君之季父也，宗族盛多，居處兵衞甚設，臣欲使人刺之，（衆）終莫能就。今足下幸而不棄，請益其車騎壯士可爲足下輔翼者。」聶政曰：「韓之與衞，相去中閒不甚遠，今殺人之相，相又國君之親，此其勢不可以多人，多人不能無生得失，生得失則語泄，語泄是韓舉國而與仲子爲讎，豈不殆哉！」遂謝車騎人徒，聶政乃辭獨行。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m015-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"聶政母","kind":"person","person_id":"0e4_dav_p5t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m015-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"聶政","kind":"person","person_id":"ri4_ypz_y8z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m015-0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"政","kind":"person","person_id":"ri4_ypz_y8z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m015-0036","start":36,"end":39,"surface":"嚴仲子","kind":"person","person_id":"acr_zxn_ca3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m015-0081","start":81,"end":84,"surface":"嚴仲子","kind":"person","person_id":"acr_zxn_ca3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m015-0102","start":102,"end":103,"surface":"政","kind":"person","person_id":"ri4_ypz_y8z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m015-0123","start":123,"end":124,"surface":"政","kind":"person","person_id":"ri4_ypz_y8z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m015-0137","start":137,"end":138,"surface":"政","kind":"person","person_id":"ri4_ypz_y8z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m015-0139","start":139,"end":140,"surface":"政","kind":"person","person_id":"ri4_ypz_y8z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m015-0142","start":142,"end":144,"surface":"老母","kind":"person","person_id":"0e4_dav_p5t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m015-0145","start":145,"end":147,"surface":"老母","kind":"person","person_id":"0e4_dav_p5t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m015-0153","start":153,"end":154,"surface":"政","kind":"person",